<h1>猛禽龙 (Megaraptor)</h1>
<table class="d chm-compat-grid" style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:20px 0;font-size:14px;background:#fefcf7;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;"><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#eee6d8;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">资料栏位</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#eee6d8;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;">猛禽龙 (Megaraptor)<br/><small>大型动物</small></td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">生命骰</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">8d8+43(79HP)</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">先攻</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">+2</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">速度</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">60英尺(12格)</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">防御等级</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">17(-1体型、+2敏捷、+6天生)、接触11、措手不及15</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">基本攻击/擒抱</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">+6 / +15</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">攻击</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">勾爪+10近战(2d6+5)</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">全力攻击</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">勾爪+10近战(2d6+5)及2前爪抓+5近战(1d4+2)及啮咬+5近战(1d8+2)</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">占据/触及</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">10英尺 / 5英尺</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">特殊攻击</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">猛扑</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">特殊能力</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">昏暗视觉、灵敏嗅觉</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">豁免</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">强韧+10、反射+8、意志+4</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">属性</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">力量21、敏捷15、体质21、智力2、感知15、魅力10</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">技能</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">躲藏+9、跳跃+27、聆听+12、侦察+12、生存+12</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">专长</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">健跑、健壮、追踪</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">环境</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">热暖带森林</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">组织</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">单独、成双或一批(3-6)</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">挑战级数</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">6</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">宝藏</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">无</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">阵营</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">总是绝对中立</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">进化</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">9-16HD(大型)；17-24HD(超大型)</td></tr><tr><td style="width:130px;border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:center;background:#fcfaf6;color:#A44797;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:middle;">等级修正值</td><td style="border:1px solid #d4c7b6;padding:8px 12px;text-align:left;background:#fff;color:#2a241d;vertical-align:middle;">—</td></tr></table>
<p>猛禽龙是恐爪龙的放大版，约12英尺高，24英尺长。其外型、习性与能力均与恐爪龙相同。</p>
<div class="a"><p><b>猛扑(特异)：</b>如果猛禽龙向对手冲刺，就算已经做出移动动作，仍可进行全力攻击。</p></div>
<div class="a"><p><b>技能：</b>猛禽龙在进行"躲藏"、"跳跃"、"聆听"、"侦察"、"生存"检定时具有+8种族加值。</p></div>
